    "detailed_description": "The Armed Forces of Ukraine is a game about the Armed Forces of Ukraine.<br />\r\nAFU game offers you to take on a role of a soldier of the Armed Forces of Ukraine and try yourself in a performance of various missions with a plot.<br />\r\nStarting with the banal defense of the base, to the destruction of the legendary orc cruiser.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n\u2022 The game has a store where you can buy weapons, bulletproof vests and helmets to use in various missions or free modes.<br />\r\nAt the moment, there are ore than 10 types of weapons in the game:<br />\r\nMachine gun,<br />\r\nShotgun,<br />\r\nSniper and so on.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are free modes in the game:<br />\r\n\u2022 Bombardment mode - a mode where you can relax and drop an infinite number of missiles on orcs(kacapi), who are trying to reach cities.<br />\r\nFor every orc you shoot down, you get hryvnia.<br />\r\nAlso there is a shop available in this mode, where you can request help from soldiers who will demolish orcs or buy bullets for turrets that will demolish tanks and armored personnel carriers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Base defense mode - you can choose a weapon, a map, adjust strength of enemies and endlessly crush orcs yourself.<br />\r\nIn base defense mode, orcs attack you from different sides.<br />\r\nYou need to survive a certain number of waves and prevent orcs from destroying the Ukrainian server with important information.<br />\r\nAlso in this mode, a shop is available, where you can ask for help from soldiers who will destroy orcs or buy bullets or a first aid kit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 In each free mode, you can choose the difficulty and turn on/off furious rock music!",
    "about_the_game": "The Armed Forces of Ukraine is a game about the Armed Forces of Ukraine.<br />\r\nAFU game offers you to take on a role of a soldier of the Armed Forces of Ukraine and try yourself in a performance of various missions with a plot.<br />\r\nStarting with the banal defense of the base, to the destruction of the legendary orc cruiser.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n\u2022 The game has a store where you can buy weapons, bulletproof vests and helmets to use in various missions or free modes.<br />\r\nAt the moment, there are ore than 10 types of weapons in the game:<br />\r\nMachine gun,<br />\r\nShotgun,<br />\r\nSniper and so on.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are free modes in the game:<br />\r\n\u2022 Bombardment mode - a mode where you can relax and drop an infinite number of missiles on orcs(kacapi), who are trying to reach cities.<br />\r\nFor every orc you shoot down, you get hryvnia.<br />\r\nAlso there is a shop available in this mode, where you can request help from soldiers who will demolish orcs or buy bullets for turrets that will demolish tanks and armored personnel carriers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Base defense mode - you can choose a weapon, a map, adjust strength of enemies and endlessly crush orcs yourself.<br />\r\nIn base defense mode, orcs attack you from different sides.<br />\r\nYou need to survive a certain number of waves and prevent orcs from destroying the Ukrainian server with important information.<br />\r\nAlso in this mode, a shop is available, where you can ask for help from soldiers who will destroy orcs or buy bullets or a first aid kit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 In each free mode, you can choose the difficulty and turn on/off furious rock music!",
    "short_description": "AFU game offers you to take on the role of a soldier of the Armed Forces of Ukraine and try yourself in a performance of various missions with a plot. Starting with a banal base defense, to the destruction of the legendary orc`s cruiser.",
